# Copy to .env.local and enter a restricted BROWSER key locally.
# Browser keys are visible in network requests. Restrict to Map Tiles API and
# http://127.0.0.1:5173/* (plus only your approved deployment origins).
# Enable billing and Map Tiles API yourself; configure quotas in Google Cloud.
# This app sends no Google request until you click Load Google 3D.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
